# Dobeu.net — Cursor Agent Rules

> STOP. Read `CLAUDE.md` in the repo root first. It is the single source of truth.
> This file exists because Cursor resolves `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` automatically.

## Pre-Session Hook (mandatory before any edit)

```bash
cat CLAUDE.md                              # read full rulebook
cat .agent/HANDOFF.md                      # previous agent notes + open items
cat STATUS.md                              # current phase + blockers
git fetch --all && git status              # sync before editing
gh pr list --repo Dobeu-tech-eco/dobeu-net --state open  # audit open PRs
# then append your session-open note to .agent/HANDOFF.md
```

## Post-Session Hook (mandatory before closing)

```bash
pnpm lint && pnpm type-check && pnpm test:ci && pnpm build  # checkpoint gate
# append session-close note to .agent/HANDOFF.md
# update STATUS.md
git add -A && git commit -m "type(scope): description [checkpoint-N]"
git push origin <feature-branch>  # NEVER push to main or dev directly
```

