## Code Rules

### TypeScript
- Strict mode — no `any`, no `@ts-ignore` without justification comment
- All Supabase mutations via Server Actions in `lib/actions/` — no client-side writes
- `createClient()` for user-scoped (RLS); `createAdminClient()` for admin ops only (server-only)
- `export const dynamic = "force-dynamic"` on `/admin/*` and `/api/lead`

### CSS / Tailwind
- Tailwind v4 syntax: `@theme inline {}`, `@custom-variant dark`
- `bg-background` must be on `<html>` tag in `app/layout.tsx`
- No gradients on primary elements — solid colors only
- No `space-*` classes — use `gap-*`
- No arbitrary values like `p-[16px]` — use scale `p-4`

### React / Next.js
- Server components by default; `"use client"` only when truly needed
- No `useEffect` for data fetching — use RSC or SWR
- No `localStorage` for data persistence — use Supabase
- `lazyMotion + domAnimation` from `motion/react` — not full bundle import
- `useReducedMotion()` on every animated component
- No `initial={{ opacity: 0 }}` on above-the-fold elements (LCP regression)

### Security
- No `'unsafe-inline'` in `script-src` CSP (after Step 5)
- No in-memory rate limiting — use `@upstash/ratelimit` with Upstash Redis
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` for static strings — use JSX entities
- Validate `next` redirect param against allowlist before use
- No hardcoded secrets — use Vercel Vars or Doppler

### Accessibility
- Skip-to-main-content as first focusable element in every layout
- `aria-modal="true"` on all dialogs; `aria-current="page"` on active nav links
- Full-opacity focus rings — not `outline-ring/50`
- `aria-hidden="true"` on decorative SVGs
- Run axe-core audit before any accessibility checkpoint passes

## Design System (Brand Tokens)

### Colors — dark default
```
Primary:       #6B5CE7  (indigo)
Accent:        #F4A261  (amber — CTA on dark)
Dark bg:       #1A1A2E  | Dark elevated: #242440
Light bg:      #FFFFFF  | Border dark: #2A2A45
Text:          #FFFFFF / #E0E0E0 / #9A9AB0
```

### Typography
- Headings: Nunito ExtraBold 800 (confirm with Jeremy — may stay Geist)
- Body: Geist Sans | Code: JetBrains Mono | Max 2 families

### Rules
- NO gradients, NO heavy shadows, NO emoji icons
- CTA: amber fill on dark, indigo fill on light; ONE primary CTA per screen
- Max 5 colors per view; WCAG AA contrast required

